11.steps:
1. Go to the VPN->Settings, add a VPN policy, select TI, Preshare Secret, fill in Policy Name and Primary GW on General Tab;
2. On Proposal Tab, Select Aggressive as Exchange, enable PFS;
IPSec Protocal select ESP;
For IKE and IPSec DH Group, select the first item (256-bit Random ECP Group) from EC DH Group;
For IPSec Encryption, select the first item (AESGCM16-128).
3. Apply configuration
4. On Network->Routings, add a route policy with X0_Subnet as Src, Remote_VPN subnet as Dst and TI policy as interface
5. start vpn traffic, check tunnel negotiation and vpn traffic.
6. Repeat Step1-4, in step 3, select the next SuiteB item for EC DH algorithm and IPSec Encryption until each one is tested.

